      "puller nip: spring-loaded 1.75 mm filament grip; spool winder, traverse and slip tensioner replace SPOOL-ENV",
      "power policy: 500 W soft scheduler target; normal virtual peak 416 W, >500 W WARN+logged, absolute hard ceiling 792 W; M1/M2 loads remain UNRATED estimates",
